From 436972f93c8720ec1502d1b3b354f88ab2f0e545 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: AzediZ <145237384+AzediZ@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 15 Oct 2026 22:38:04 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 98/98] DED complexes: the 48 rated complexes, 1/10 to 10/10

There were no rated complexes, so the scanner never found one. Each
complex is now a signature for its faction and security band: an entry
gate that only takes the ships its rating allows, two to five pockets
of the faction's deadspace ships in waves, and an overseer in the last
pocket who drops Overseer's Personal Effects and completes the site.
Bosses come from the client data where it names one, the gate limits
and OPE tiers from 2011-2012 pages; waves are standard ones sized by
rating. utils/ded/gen_ded_sql.py writes the migration.

GM /ded lists the complexes and /ded spawn rating|dungeonID puts one
next to your ship.
---
